  "text": "Recipe: Tikka Masala Potatoes\nCreator: Sharmila Vedam\nCategory: Potato Dish\nIngredients: 18-20 baby potatoes, 1 Tbsp tikka masala (salt-free), 1 Tbsp garlic powder, 1 Tbsp onion powder, 1/2 cup of aquafaba, Salt (to taste), Chilli powder (optional; to taste), avocado crème\nCooking methods: boil, bake\nInstructions: Boil the potatoes till they are almost 80% cooked. Do not cook them completely.\nTransfer the potatoes onto a baking pan. Using a back of a bowl or a tumbler, gently smash the potatoes.\nIn a bowl, mix together spices & aquafaba.\nBrush the spice liquid on each of the potatoes.\nBake at 350F for about 7-8 mins, flip over, then brush the spices and bake again for another 7-8 mins.\nNotes: A recipe with TUBERS (potatoes) & SPICES.",
